# 16. Conclusion

The India Train Delay Root Cause Analysis project provides a comprehensive analytical view of railway operational inefficiencies using Python and Power BI.

The analysis reveals that station congestion, seasonal operational disruptions, and train-level reliability issues are the primary contributors to railway delays.

The developed dashboard enables data-driven operational monitoring and supports strategic decision-making for improving punctuality, reducing severe disruptions, and enhancing overall passenger experience.

This project highlights the practical application of data analytics and business intelligence techniques in solving real-world transportation and operational challenges.

